WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.360
Lean in. This is a studio daguerreotype:
an image made on a polished,

2
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:10.670
silver-coated plate, small and precious,
set in a gilt frame inside a case.

3
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:15.240
The backdrop is neutral.
The man's role as a leader, a diplomat,

4
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:20.540
or a negotiator is gone.
He becomes a type, an example of Indianness,

5
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.750
rather than a specific person
with specific concerns.

6
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.150
Even his name has not come down
to us with the picture.
